## Terraform
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored: it pins provider versions and belongs
# in version control, the same way a package lock file does.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log

# Variable files carry secrets by definition here: neon_connection_string is marked
# sensitive and has no default. Ignored so a local apply cannot commit a live database
# password. Prefer TF_VAR_neon_connection_string in the environment over a file.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

